%I A401989 #12 Nov 17 2026 19:49:40
%S A401989 0,100,4128,136620,4097236,116117760,3172065624,84444825220,
%T A401989 2205432434592,56755488701700,1443549147405940,36367461727238400,
%U A401989 908987189228257968,22568635032628250020,557156473711000082976,13687029631623175687260,334790523738436708799764
%N A401989 Number of spanning trees of the 3 X n Klein bottle grid graph using exactly 2 twist edges.
%C A401989 The 3 X n Klein bottle grid graph has 3n vertices arranged in a 3 X n grid with periodic boundary conditions in the vertical direction (forming a cylinder in each column) and antiperiodic boundary conditions with twist in the horizontal direction: (r, n-1) ~ (2-r, 0). Three edges cross the twist: (0,n-1)-(2,0), (1,n-1)-(1,0), (2,n-1)-(0,0). This sequence counts spanning trees containing exactly two of these three edges.
%C A401989 The total number of spanning trees of the 3 X n Klein bottle grid graph decomposes as A400234(n) = c_0(n) + c_1(n) + c_2(n) + c_3(n), where c_j(n) counts spanning trees using exactly j twist edges. This sequence is c_2(n). The twist-free component c_0(n) counts spanning trees of the cylinder C_3 X P_n.
%H A401989 Paolo Xausa, <a href="/A401989/b401989.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..733</a>
%H A401989 <a href="/index/Rec#order_06">Index entries for linear recurrences with constant coefficients</a>, signature (48,-624,1154,-624,48,-1).
%F A401989 a(n) is the coefficient of y^2 in C(n,y), where C(n,y) is defined in A401537.
%F A401989 a(n) = 48*a(n-1) - 624*a(n-2) + 1154*a(n-3) - 624*a(n-4) + 48*a(n-5) - a(n-6) for n >= 7.
%e A401989 For n=1, the 3 X 1 Klein bottle grid has 7 spanning trees total, of which a(1) = 0 use exactly 2 twist edges.
%e A401989 For n=2, the 3 X 2 Klein bottle grid has 350 spanning trees total, of which a(2) = 100 use exactly 2 twist edges.
%t A401989 LinearRecurrence[{48, -624, 1154, -624, 48, -1}, {0, 100, 4128, 136620, 4097236, 116117760}, 20] (* _Paolo Xausa_, Nov 17 2026 *)
%o A401989 (Python) # uses C() from A401537
%o A401989 from sympy import symbols, expand
%o A401989 def a(n):
%o A401989     y = symbols('y')
%o A401989     return expand(C(n, y)).coeff(y, 2)
%Y A401989 Cf. A400234 (total spanning trees), A401537 (c_1 component), A006235 (n-prism graph), A020871 (Möbius strip).
%K A401989 nonn,easy,new
